[I] C++ library for reading and writing Standard MIDI Files

[T] Portsmf (Port Standard MIDI File) is a cross-platform C++ library for
[T] reading and writing Standard MIDI Files and the Allegro text format. It
[T] provides data structures for representing music as sequences of tracks
[T] and events in memory and is used by Audacity and Tenacity.

[U] https://codeberg.org/tenacityteam/portsmf

[A] Portsmf Authors
